The scientific construction remains owned by the original PANELBUILD module.
This adapter binds its feature reader to Q1 v1 or Q1 v2, rejects any C3 width
other than the complete encoder vector, and gates the panel's synthetic flag on
an independent audit of the cached physical content.
"""

